# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Every page from a fresh boot, for the screen recording (rec=4 sb_debug=1, 11-11: the tester saw the widgets page flicker
# when he opened it right after a boot): each step, then 20 s still while the host fetches the ring of the last seconds
# (the "wait 20" lines). The widgets page as soon as the home screen is up, held; scrolled; every home page to the App
# Library, scrolled; Spotlight; Notification Center; Control Center; the widgets page again. RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.allpages.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 38
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 6
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
