/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 2
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 2 swipe 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.3 400 wait 2 button home wait 2
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
